44\n--- a/doc/setup-for-wsl.md\n+++ b/doc/setup-for-wsl.md\n@@ -75,37 +75,44 @@ $ git clone https://github.com/jonas/tig.git ~/.local/src/tig\n $ cd ~/.local/src/tig\n $ make configure\n $ ./configure\n $ make\n $ make install\n $ ln -s ${HOME}/.local/src/tig/src/tig ${HOME}/.local/bin/tig\n ```\n\n-8. neovim\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3059\u308b\u3002\n+8. SKK\u8f9e\u66f8\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3059\u308b\u3002\n+```bash\n+$ cd ~/.local/src/skk\n+$ wget http://openlab.jp/skk/dic/SKK-JISYO.L.gz\n+$ gzip -d SKK-JISYO.L.gz\n+```\n+\n+9. neovim\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3059\u308b\u3002\n ```bash\n $ sudo apt install -y ninja-build gettext cmake unzip curl build-essential\n $ git clone https://github.com/neovim/neovim ~/.local/src/neovim\n $ cd ~/src/neovim\n $ make CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release CMAKE_EXTRA_FLAGS=\"-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$HOME/.local/build/neovim\"\n $ make install\n $ ln -s ${HOME}/.local/build/neovim/bin/nvim ${HOME}/.local/bin/nvim\n ```\n\n-9. dotfiles\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3059\u308b\u3002\n+10. dotfiles\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3059\u308b\u3002\n ```bash\n $ git clone https://github.com/nabezokodaikon/dotfiles.git ~/dotfiles\n $ cd ~/dotfiles/script\n $ ./install.sh\n $ ./git-config.sh\n ```\n \u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u6709\u52b9\u5316\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u30ed\u30b0\u30a2\u30a6\u30c8->\u30ed\u30b0\u30a4\u30f3\u3059\u308b\u3002\n\n-10. \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u5316\n+11. \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u5316\n ```bash\n # \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a00\u8a9e\u30d1\u30c3\u30af\u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\n $ sudo apt -y install language-pack-ja\n\n # \u30ed\u30b1\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\n $ sudo update-locale LANG=ja_JP.UTF8\n\n # Ubuntu\u3092\u518d\u8d77\u52d5", "created_at": "2024-04-28T12:55:26Z", "repo": "dotfiles", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a3ef0c5774d1cbc790d05d9bb5d400ec048f63da"